\code{densityMaps} are recording the posterior probability/frequencies of being in a given state/range along branches.
In deepSTRAPP format, \code{densityMaps} is a list of objects of class \code{"densityMap"} where each object corresponds to
the frequency of presence/absence of a state/range.
